<title>INDIA: India Ponds sets 1997 interim dividend.</title>
<headline>India Ponds sets 1997 interim dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever subsidiary and cosmetics maker Ponds India Ltd said on Wednesday it had set an interim dividend of 9.5 rupees per share in the first half of calendar 1997 compared to an interim dividend of 7.5 rupees per share in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
